---
// The ephemeral promise — centered headline, hanging-left mono bullets.
---
<section class="frame pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-20 md:pb-28" aria-labelledby="ephemeral-heading">
  <h2
    id="ephemeral-heading"
    class="display-line font-display font-bold text-charcoal text-center"
    style="font-size: clamp(44px, 8vw, 140px); letter-spacing: -0.055em; line-height: 0.92;"
  >
    <span class="block">Every link expires.</span>
    <span class="block text-coral">Every file is deleted.</span>
    <span class="block text-charcoal/40">By design.</span>
  </h2>

  <ul class="mt-16 md:mt-24 flex flex-col gap-5 max-w-[720px]">
    <li class="flex items-start gap-4 font-mono text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.55] tracking-[0.02em] text-charcoal/70">
      <span class="text-violet-hot flex-none" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span>default · 24 hours · custom from 5 minutes to 30 days</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-start gap-4 font-mono text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.55] tracking-[0.02em] text-charcoal/70">
      <span class="text-violet-hot flex-none" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span>one anonymous bearer · no accounts ever</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-start gap-4 font-mono text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.55] tracking-[0.02em] text-charcoal/70">
      <span class="text-violet-hot flex-none" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <span>bucket private · signed reads · 60-second TTL</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p class="mt-10 font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[0.03em] text-charcoal/50 max-w-[720px]">
    <span class="text-violet-hot">Pro</span> unlocks cross-device sync and 30-day links.
    <a href="/pricing" class="text-charcoal/70 hover:text-violet-hot transition-colors underline-offset-4 underline decoration-charcoal/20">See pricing →</a>
  </p>
</section>
